  <translations>
    <en>
      <description>Rain Bird 100-HV is a solenoid valve used to control individual irrigation zones. The valve opens when it receives a signal from a compatible irrigation controller and closes when the signal stops. This version has a 1-inch female thread.

Technical details
Operating voltage: 24 V. Flow rate: 0.05–6.82 m³/h. Operating pressure: 1.0–10.3 bar. Maximum water temperature: 43°C. The 9 V version is intended for compatible battery-powered controllers; 24 V versions are used with compatible mains-powered irrigation controllers.

Installation should be carried out in an accessible valve box and in accordance with the controller and system specifications.</description>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>b0</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>b00</_key>
