          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>100-HV</text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>b01</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text> — a 1″ diaphragm solenoid valve for automatic irrigation.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>h1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>h10</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Purpose and operating principle</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>p1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>p10</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>The controller energises the solenoid, which operates the diaphragm and opens the water passage. When the signal stops, the valve closes automatically. The HV series is a compact solution for individual zones. Its glass-filled polypropylene body, Buna-N diaphragm and self-cleaning pilot filter support reliable operation.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>h2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>h20</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Construction and model-specific features</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>p2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>p20</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Standard HV has no flow-control handle. The eccentric diaphragm supports smoother closing. Standard HV has no manual flow control; choose the HVF version when this adjustment is required.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>h3</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
