          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Size 1″; operating pressure 1,0–10,3 bar; flow 0,05–6,82 m³/h; solenoid 24 VAC. Actual flow depends on pipe, filter and fitting losses as well as available pressure.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>h4</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>h40</_key>
